<p><span style="font-size:16px;"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman,Times New Roman,Times,serif;">Dear {{CLIENT_NAME}},</span></span></p>

<p><span style="font-size:16px;"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman,Times New Roman,Times,serif;">We hope this email finds you well.</span></span></p>

<p><span style="font-size:16px;"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman,Times New Roman,Times,serif;">We are pleased to inform you that our team has completed the comprehensive budget estimation and architectural planning for your upcoming project, <strong>{{OPPORTUNITY_NAME}}</strong>. We have carefully analyzed the requirements to ensure the most accurate and efficient allocation of resources.</span></span></p>

<p><span style="font-size:16px;"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman,Times New Roman,Times,serif;"><strong>What is Included in this Review?</strong><br />
This budget proposal covers the complete financial breakdown, including:</span></span></p>

<ul>
	<li><span style="font-size:16px;"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman,Times New Roman,Times,serif;"><strong>Architectural Design Costs:</strong> Detailed line items for design phases.</span></span></li>
	<li><span style="font-size:16px;"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman,Times New Roman,Times,serif;"><strong>Execution Budget:</strong> Estimated costs for materials and labor.</span></span></li>
	<li><span style="font-size:16px;"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman,Times New Roman,Times,serif;"><strong>Project Timeline:</strong> An estimated duration of <strong>{{DURATION}} </strong>.</span></span></li>
</ul>

<p><span style="font-size:16px;"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman,Times New Roman,Times,serif;">To ensure we stay on schedule, we kindly request you to review these details at your earliest convenience. Your approval will allow us to immediately mobilize our team and begin the execution phase.</span></span></p>
<br />
<a href="{{APPROVAL_LINK}}" style="background-color:#0070d2; color:#ffffff; display:inline-block; padding:14px 28px; text-decoration:none; border-radius:4px; font-weight:bold; font-family:Arial, sans-serif; font-size:16px;">Review &amp; Approve Proposal</a><br />
&nbsp;
<p><span style="font-size:16px;"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman,Times New Roman,Times,serif;">If you feel any adjustments are needed, you can request changes directly through the link above by providing your remarks. Our team is standing by to assist with any questions you may have.</span></span></p>

<p><span style="font-size:16px;"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman,Times New Roman,Times,serif;">We look forward to bringing your vision to life.</span></span></p>

<p>Sincerely,<br />
Arelia Team.</p>
